#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Angelo 1.0 is the first release: Blender with an AI assistant built in. Describe what you want, see the change as a preview, and approve it. Everything stays undoable, and all of Blender is still there."
msgstr "Angelo 1.0 adalah rilis pertama: Blender dengan asisten AI bawaan. Jelaskan yang Anda inginkan, lihat perubahannya sebagai pratinjau, lalu setujui. Semuanya tetap bisa diurungkan, dan seluruh Blender tetap tersedia."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Angelo 1.0.1 updates Angelo's legal notices. Nothing changes in how Angelo works."
msgstr "Angelo 1.0.1 memperbarui pemberitahuan hukum Angelo. Tidak ada yang berubah dalam cara kerja Angelo."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Angelo 1.0.2 connects Claude Code and Codex to Angelo over MCP, and renders on your GPU by default."
msgstr "Angelo 1.0.2 menghubungkan Claude Code dan Codex ke Angelo melalui MCP, dan merender dengan GPU Anda secara default."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Angelo 1.0.3 improves how the agent works in Blender, makes saving safer, and carries fixes from upstream Blender."
msgstr "Angelo 1.0.3 meningkatkan cara agen bekerja di Blender, membuat penyimpanan lebih aman, serta membawa perbaikan dari proyek Blender resmi."

