#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Claude and Codex read the same Blender facts, including how the Sky Texture's sun is aimed and how its single- and multiple-scattering skies differ."
msgstr "Claude dan Codex membaca fakta Blender yang sama, termasuk cara mengarahkan matahari pada Sky Texture dan perbedaan langit hamburan tunggal dan hamburan gandanya."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "In our tests, when the agent builds a sky, the Sky Texture's sun now lines up with the scene's sunlight."
msgstr "Dalam uji kami, saat agen membuat langit, matahari Sky Texture kini sejajar dengan cahaya matahari adegan."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Claude now works from Angelo's own instructions. In our timed tests it cost less, completed more test scenes and was no slower."
msgstr "Claude kini bekerja dengan instruksi milik Angelo sendiri. Dalam uji berwaktu kami, biayanya lebih rendah, adegan uji yang selesai lebih banyak, dan tidak lebih lambat."

#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "Claude knows how to start a render or another background job without looking it up first, as Codex already did."
msgstr "Claude tahu cara memulai render atau pekerjaan latar belakang lain tanpa mencarinya dulu, seperti yang sudah dilakukan Codex."

