#~ msgid "Restore was not applied: the restored scene could not be installed while add-on load handlers ran. The document was reloaded exactly from the protected safety snapshot taken before Restore, with the load handlers of {addons} suspended for that reload, so nothing was lost. Disable {addons}, then Restore again. No workspace files were changed. Safety snapshot {snapshot} stays available."
